crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003440\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003441\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003443\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015583\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015584\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000082\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000488\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"87004e42-c4bd-4468-8b83-00f122c59dd9\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007316\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008328\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007533\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":197,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":8